 urces\n→\n	 \n			School Health-Related Services – Draft Rates Public R
 eview and Comment\nSchool Health-Related Services – Draft Rates Public R
 eview and Comment\nSep 25\, 2026\nOn\nOctober 9\, 2026\n\, the Department 
 with our vendor Milliman\, will host an online public forum to present the
  recommended draft rates\, rate models\, and supporting rationale for cert
 ain school health-related services. Interested parties will have the oppor
 tunity to provide public comments.\nFollowing the presentation\, the draft
  rates and models will be available online\, and vendor Milliman will acce
 pt written comments. We will summarize all comments and include an explana
 tion of whether and how we incorporated the feedback into the final rate d
 etermination.\nAs providers and other interested parties\, your feedback i
 s important. We encourage your participation. In preparation of this forum
 \, please review presented materials to date on the\nMaineCare Rate System
  Reform\nwebpage.\nForum Details\nSchool Health-Related Services: Draft Ra
 te Presentation and Public Comment\nFriday\, October 9\, 2026\, 12:00 PM 
 – 1:30 PM\nMeeting Registration Information\nMeeting Registration - Zoom
 \nFor questions on the rate determination process\, please contact\nJessic
 a Levesque\n\, MaineCare’s Rate Reform Project Lead.\n*This notice is se
 nt pursuant to\nRate Reform law\n.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/provide
 rs/provider-bulletins/school-health-related-services-draft-rates-public-re
 view-and-comment-2026-09-25
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/school-hea
 lth-related-services-draft-rates-public-review-and-comment-2026-09-25
